  "description": "SDK for Robotics Client & Server development using OPC UA. The OPC UA Robotics Companion Specification defines a standardized information model for industrial robots and robotic systems. It enables seamless integration of robots into OPC UA environments by providing a unified interface for motion control, state monitoring, diagnostics, and execution of robotic programs. The model supports interoperability across different robot manufacturers and simplifies the integration of robots into higher-level automation and IT systems. This facilitates flexible production, improves system transparency, and accelerates the deployment of robotics in smart manufacturing environments.",
